<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld says 9-mth net 2.086 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Megaworld says 9-mth net 2.086 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30.</p>
<p>	    (in billion pesos)</p>
<p>    Consolidated sales    7.444 vs 6.019</p>
<p>    Net income		2.086 vs 0.619</p>
<p>Note: Megaworld Properties and Holdings Inc.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8936</p>
</text>
